    "title": "TVACVB appoints new board member - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Mingo County, West Virginia\nTVACVB appoints new board member\nBy Heather Duty Staff writer,\n15 days agoThe Tug Valley Area Convention and Visitors Bureau added a new member — Candice Harper Jones — to its board during a recent meeting on July 2. Jones, a lifelong resident of Mingo County, said “I am incredibly thankful to live and serve here. I have been the Mingo County Sexual Assault Advocate with CONTACT Rape Crisis Center for the lasteight8 and half years, as well as a certified Child Forensic Interviewer.”",
